        "original_id": "114b373c-1e2a-583f-a528-2acbc16ab7a4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Alligator, Nightwing, The Godfather Part II, Tentacles, The Pack, Piranha, Great White\n- People: Lewis Teague, John Sayles, Robert Forster, Robin Riker, Michael V. Gazzo\n- Concepts: Jaws rip-offs, Academy Award nominations\n\nFacts:\n- In 1974, Michael V. Gazzo was nominated for an Academy Award for his role in The Godfather Part II.\n- In 1980, Alligator was released as an American horror film.\n- Alligator was directed by Lewis Teague and written by John Sayles.\n- Alligator starred Robert Forster, Robin Riker, and Michael V. Gazzo.\n- In the late 1970s and early 1980s, Nightwing was described as one of many Jaws rip-offs.\n- The Jaws rip-off films named with Nightwing included Tentacles, The Pack, Piranha, Alligator, and Great White.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
